":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,66,45,44,32,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,66,45,44,32,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,66,45,44,32,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10160","city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,66,45,44,32,53],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1019605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"张鲁之弟。张鲁迎战刘备期间，与马超分兵作战，导致马超败走。曹操前来进攻汉中时亦有出战迎敌，但不敌魏国大将张郃等人。张鲁欲降之际建议火烧国库而逃，但不被张鲁所采纳，便一同逃至巴中，曹操再次逼近时出战迎击许褚，被其斩落马下。","tc":"張魯之弟。張魯迎戰劉備期間，與馬超分兵作戰，導致馬超敗走。曹操前來進攻漢中時亦有出戰迎敵，但不敵魏國大將張郃等人。張魯欲降之際建議火燒國庫而逃，但不被張魯所采納，便一同逃至巴中，曹操再次逼近時出戰迎擊許褚，被其斬落馬下。","en":"Younger brother of Zhang Lu. During Zhang Lu's campaign against Liu Bei, he divided his forces while fighting alongside Ma Chao, leading to Ma Chao's defeat. When Cao Cao invaded Hanzhong, he also rode out to meet the enemy but was outmatched by Wei generals such as Zhang He. When Zhang Lu considered surrendering, he suggested burning the treasury and fleeing, but Zhang Lu rejected this advice. They retreated together to Bazhong, and when Cao Cao's forces closed in once more, he rode out to challenge Xu Chu, only to be cut down from his horse.","jp":"張魯の弟。張魯が劉備を迎え撃つ間、馬超と兵を分けて戦ったが、馬超の敗走を招いた。曹操が漢中に攻め寄せてきた際にも出陣して迎え撃ったが、魏の大将・張郃らに敵わなかった。張魯が降伏しようとした際には国庫に火を放って逃亡することを進言するも容れられず、ともに巴中へと逃れた。曹操が再び迫ると出陣して許褚を迎え撃つも、その手にかかり馬から斬り落とされた。","kr":"장로의 아우이다. 장로가 유비에 맞서 싸울 당시 마초와 군사를 나누어 싸우다 마초를 패주시켰다. 조조가 한중을 침공해 왔을 때도 출전하여 맞섰으나, 위나라 대장 장합 등을 당해내지 못했다. 장로가 항복하려 하자 국고에 방화하고 달아나자고 진언했으나, 장로가 받아들이지 않자 함께 파중으로 달아났다. 조조가 다시 진격해 오자 출전하여 허저를 요격했으나, 도리어 베여 말 아래로 떨어졌다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10375","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"卫","nameTc":"衛","nameEn":"Wei","nameJp":"衛","nameKr":"위","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"张卫","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"191","city":"CS1036","gender":"0","rule":"74","force":"66","wise":"45","politics":"44","charm":"32","will":"53","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"2","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"21/21/66/21/21/11/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5400","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"2000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010301","professions":"3/0/0/2/0/0/2/1/2/0/0/1/0/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/2/1/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"10","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3000","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"172","show":"191","death":"215","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImpor